{"id":"vod_sn_39104","vodId":"39104","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"动画同好会","name_cn":"动画同好会","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/36b9cc7cccfdb356cad8cfe3474cf378.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在立咲钟湖学园高中部内，阿佐谷未乃爱（本渡枫 配音）是刚刚来到此处进修的高中生，个性有些懵懵懂懂冒冒失失的她有着容易被卷入麻烦之中的体质，在这种体质的作祟之下，她遇见了上井草有栖（千本木彩花 配音）。上井是含着金汤匙出生的千金大小姐，却意外的对动画深深的着迷，上井拉着对动画并不是十分了解的阿佐谷成立了动画研究社。　　个性非常安静沉稳的高圆寺美子（东城日沙子 配音）、表面看来是帅哥但实际上是重度OTAKU的中野光辉（寺岛悙太 配音）、个性异常中二因此被同学们孤立的武藏境快（伊藤节生 配音），动画研究社迎来的，是一张张崭新的面孔。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vAqCVDNkGH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jfa35fFNuv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zt4ZdnW5Jk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YsXGGvfHmy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4tJSX74aJX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rKhAcnu8WU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7y032UfxRF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZRjnZT6Kzk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vmkgmfzi8s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uQDkxxwrFE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1uC1juvWYM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uqfE7z6E0m1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:50.284Z"}